    {
      "type": "note",
      "id": "rAFP8",
      "x": 4080,
      "y": 1140,
      "name": "note-vibes-geometry",
      "width": 0,
      "height": 0,
      "content": "VIBES STATE 0 — geometry (2026-08-21). BG = vibes-crate.poster.jpg = TRUE hold frame (reverse-clip first frame = crate-vibes final frame). NOT the plate: plate-vibes.png is pristine Meshy still, ~15 mean brighter/sharper than what renders. Grade varies by arrival ~6pts R (via-Mixes brighter than via-Crate) — treatment must read on both posters. Seats y=227/410/603 (1920). Baked sleeve ~164px sq. Slot 172 = 164+4px overhang/side. Row 4 DEAD (bins occlude). Outer columns drift larger (perspective) — eye-nudge per slot. Portrait-safe x 656-1264 (cyan guides): >=2 slots must live inside. Slot x/y here are CD PROPOSALS ONLY — Al B owns placement. Treatment = locked Mixes rest (2px white stroke + shadow + amber multiply); Vibes sampler (5px cream frame candidate) NOT yet run. || TILT PASS 2026-08-21: baked-sleeve leans measured from side edges (keystone = depth lean, not rotation; rotation approximates). Occlusion safe at ZERO rotation (max keystone displacement <=4px = overhang). VERDICT (Al B): ZERO ROTATION on all slots - measured tilts applied then REJECTED by eye (read weird). Covers sit square; occlusion safe (keystone <= overhang). Do not relitigate."
    },
