      "name": "note-crate-geometry",
      "width": 0,
      "height": 0,
      "content": "CRATE STATE 0 — geometry (2026-08-21). BG = crate-counter.poster.jpg = TRUE hold (reversed-clip first frame = counter->crate final frame). 2nd arrival (vibes ring return) within drift: mean 18, grade delta ~2.5R — overhang absorbs. LEFT GRID: seats y=190/350/510 (1920), pitch 160, baked sleeve ~158sq w/ ~20px horiz overlap between neighbors. Slot 166 = 158+4/side. PORTRAIT TENSION: left grid spans x~20-860, safe zone starts 656 — only the grid's rightmost column (~700-841) survives portrait. Heroes proposed stacked there. Bin faces (y~560-680, center) + wall crates = dig-trigger ZONE territory (semantics honesty: zone glow -> opens edits inventory), not occlusion slots. Heroes: only 2 Beatport releases exist; third slot = none until earned. Beatport art harvested at 500sq (1400 available — fold into re-pull task w/ Spotify 640s). Hero x/y are CD PROPOSALS — Al B owns placement; 'leaned' hero treatment instead of racked = open founder call. || BIN-SEAT UPDATE: heroes moved by Al B to center bin (133sq), converted to binclip wrappers — wrapper bottom edge = clip line = bin lip (measured y=678). Drag wrapper to re-bin; drag its TOP edge up to reveal more cover. No bottom stroke/shadow by construction (clipped). 4 edit covers staged bottom-left at 166 for Al B placement (gaz-nevada / frankie-workout / quimbara / grace-jones)."
